# Documentation Standards

This rule defines the documentation system and standards.

## Documentation Structure
- Getting Started guide
- Design principles
- Component documentation
- Token reference
- Guidelines and best practices
- Migration guides
- Contributing guidelines

## MDX Documentation
- Interactive code examples
- Live component previews
- Theme switching demos
- Responsive previews
- Props tables
- Usage guidelines

## Documentation Pages
### Component Pages
- Component overview
- Usage examples
- Props reference
- Accessibility notes
- Theme variations
- Related components
- Migration notes

### Guidelines Pages
- Design principles
- Accessibility guidelines
- Performance best practices
- Theme customization
